        "section": "form-and-early-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Chapter 345, still before that refinement, says the Breath Concealment Gu used to hide cultivation is at rank three and could be advanced, though Fang Yuan sets that aside for a time.",
        "chapters": [
          345
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
